flowchart TB
  lead[Lead session<br/>plans, edits, runs checks]
  advisor[advisor · Opus<br/>reviews plans and<br/>auth / RLS changes]
  designer[ui-designer · Opus<br/>design research,<br/>screenshot critique]
  subgraph devs [Developers · Sonnet]
    direction LR
    fe[frontend-developer<br/>apps/web]
    be[backend-developer<br/>apps/api, contracts]
    dbdev[db-developer<br/>supabase/]
  end
  gate{{Stop hook + handback gate<br/>bun run check must be green<br/>3 blocks, then a visible give-up}}
  reviewer[reviewer · Sonnet<br/>reads the diff,<br/>reports to the lead]
  ledger[(Failure ledger<br/>.harness/failures.jsonl)]
  graders[Read-only for agents<br/>hooks, check scripts, CI,<br/>AI-review golden set]

  lead <-- plan review --> advisor
  lead -- delegates --> devs
  lead <-- design direction --> designer
  devs -- hand back --> gate
  lead -- finish a turn --> gate
  gate -- green --> reviewer
  gate -. blocks, give-ups,<br/>recoveries .-> ledger
  graders -. define .-> gate
